    {
      "item": "Complete clean engine rebuild qualification against receipt-bound outputs.",
      "evidence": "PR #244: clean engine rebuild matches the locked JS/Wasm outputs; PR #245: independent format rebuild on all six targets. The earlier combined rebuild/relink wording was too broad: PR #244 explicitly leaves modified-library relink qualification open."
    },
    {
      "item": "Complete the precompiled format input inventory and generated font-metadata source closure.",
      "evidence": "PR #245 (aff7d36) and PR #246 (1364bb3): exact original inventories, two identical generated format/font builds and six-platform manuscript acceptance."
    },
    {
      "item": "Select original url 3.3 with its unversioned LPPL notice instead of interpreting the ambiguous url 3.4 version-2 wording.",
      "evidence": "The TeX Live 2012 final archives (revision 16864) retain the unchanged 3.3 source and documentation; source hashes and all four original component files are preserved. See specs/zellij-pdf-original-url-2026-11-24.md."
